WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
They can also say that class is common sense welfare.

2
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,980
Captain Wang, let me report to you.

3
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,180
I found a job yesterday at Xian Machinery Factory

4
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,980
Purchasing department plan outsourcing

5
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,260
How did you get it?

6
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,860
No matter how many people squeezed their heads, they still couldn't get in.

7
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,260
Section Chief Gao gave me a chance

8
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,860
Mainly engaged in unplanned procurement

9
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,260
Get urgent supplies for common sense

10
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,060
Will you still work in the future?

11
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,460
The harvesters do not have to work and the hours are not fixed.

12
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,060
I try my best to participate in the team's work

13
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,460
The obligation to advance will not be pushed back

14
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:39,830
Having a serious job is a good thing

15
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:44,750
Remember, your roots are still in the village. Don’t forget your roots. I remember them.

16
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,690
Comrade Qin Tian starts from today

17
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:54,090
Recruited as an informant by the current machinery factory

18
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:56,490
Although it is a temporary job, it is also a serious job

19
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:59,320
From now on, I will mainly do shopping outside. Everyone understands.
